Unreleased 1.2.5 [2026may28] Nathan Mills <Quipyowert2@users.noreply.github.com>
	- KXL_ReadBitmapHeader no longer loops indefinitely on corrupted BMPs.
	- KXL_LoadBitmap and KXL_ReadBitmapHeader will fail instead of exiting your program.
	- Documented KXL_ReadBitmapHeader.
	- Added AFL++ sample.c fuzz target in the test/ directory.
	- More fuzzing friendly because there are now fewer exit calls.
	- Merge eight downstream Debian patches: 000_soname_xlibs.diff,
	    020_64bits.diff, 020_alsa.diff, 020_autorepeat.diff,
	    020_badfont.diff, 020_headers.diff, 040_nonlinux.diff,
	    do_not_overrun_display_name_variable.patch
	- Add AUTHORS, touch NEWS, touch README, to satisfy autoconf
	- Import Debian Joystick support (from 1.1.6, 2003jan16)
